---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Dr. Sajjad Yousafzai"
  description="Read the privacy policy for drsajjadyousafzai.com, including how patient information is handled and protected."
  path="/privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="section legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-shell">
      <header class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal information</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-card reveal" data-delay="80">
        <p>
          This privacy policy explains how this website, drsajjadyousafzai.com, handles personal information.
          The clinic takes privacy seriously and is committed to using personal information only for patient care,
          communication, and service improvement.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we may collect</h2>
        <p>
          We may collect information you provide directly, such as your name, phone number, appointment request,
          service interests, and messages sent through the contact or WhatsApp forms. We may also collect limited
          technical information such as browser type, page visits, and general analytics data to improve the website.
        </p>

        <h2>How information is used</h2>
        <p>
          Your information may be used to respond to enquiries, arrange appointments, confirm clinic schedules,
          improve website functionality, and provide information about our services. We do not sell or rent personal
          information to third parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>Communication and appointment requests</h2>
        <p>
          When you use the contact or WhatsApp booking form, the information is used to prepare for a consultation,
          to respond to your request, or to direct you to the appropriate service. Please do not share sensitive,
          confidential, or highly private medical details in a public message or non-secure channel unless the clinic
          specifically asks for them.
        </p>

        <h2>Website analytics and cookies</h2>
        <p>
          The website may use standard analytics tools to understand how visitors use the site. This helps improve
          navigation, performance, and content. Cookies may be used for website functionality and analytics. You can
          usually manage cookie preferences in your browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain personal information only as long as necessary for clinical communication, patient scheduling,
          legal obligations, and service quality purposes. Information may be deleted or anonymised when no longer needed.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party websites</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites, maps, social media profiles, or other online services.
          We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those external websites.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may ask to review, correct, or limit the use of your personal information whenever appropriate.
          If you have a concern about how your information is handled, please contact the clinic directly.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions, please use the contact information available on the clinic website or email the clinic
          through the contact page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-section {
    padding-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .legal-shell {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .legal-card > * + * {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 1.8vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-card p,
  .legal-card li {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
</style>
